	(text "03 Gate drive: one Si8271 per IGBT (PLAN D13). EN = HV_ENABLE (pulled down on sheet 05: link unplugged or control board off = drivers off); PWM inputs pulled down; 10k gate-emitter resistors keep the IGBTs off unpowered; 1 nF C0G G-E caps against Miller turn-on. High sides: bootstrap on VDRV."
